# Secret Manager secrets mounted into both Cloud Run services (neosleep-api-dev/-prod)
# as env vars of the same name. One name per line. Read by .github/workflows/deploy-api.yml.
# Values are copied from Render by sync-secrets-from-render.sh, never committed.
# Non-secret config lives in dev.env.yaml / prod.env.yaml instead.
#
# Parity with Render as of 2026-09-25: only these four secrets were set there.
# Features whose keys were never configured on Render (Google login, Supabase Storage
# uploads, web push, OrthoApnea, Google Calendar/Maps) stay off until their secrets are
# created in Secret Manager AND added here in the same PR — a listed name without a
# secret fails the deploy.
DATABASE_URL
SESSION_SECRET
RESEND_API_KEY
INTERNAL_JOB_SECRET
